vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3001
}

docs {
  # local-craftsmen API

  Start the API with `bun run dev` from `apps/api`. `baseUrl` defaults to
  localhost:3001 at collection level; pick an environment only to override it.

  Folders map 1:1 to API resources. Each request carries assertions, so the
  whole collection doubles as a smoke suite: `bun run test:api`.
}
